	(text "Every JP ships OPEN: bridge with solder to bring the board up one stage at a time (README order); wick off to isolate. No test pad on the 10 MOhm node on purpose."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7000 175.2600 0)
		(effects
			(font
